{"term":"on the same wavelength","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:13270ba1a48d73d405","definition":"Thinking in the same way; having similar thought processes (in general).","example":"I don't really understand him; we're just not on the same wavelength.","pos":"prep_phrase","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"idiomatic","register":"idiomatic","wordFamily":["eye to eye","simpatico"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/on_the_same_wavelength#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:0743d3fcece5b5071c","definition":"In complete agreement; having the same perspective (on a particular issue).","example":"Luckily, the members of the committee were on the same wavelength, so we didn't have endless discussions about what words meant.","pos":"prep_phrase","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"idiomatic","register":"idiomatic","wordFamily":["eye to eye","simpatico"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/on_the_same_wavelength#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/En-au-on_the_same_wavelength.ogg/En-au-on_the_same_wavelength.ogg.mp3"},"wordFamily":["eye to eye","simpatico"]}